== Effects ==
* Creates 7 clusters of random [[rocks]] and other obstacles. The pathways between exits can't be blocked.
** Every [[rocks|rock]] has a 3% chance to be a [[tinted rock]].

== Strategy ==
* It is recommended to use '''XVI - The Tower?''' in a large room, as the clusters will be larger, increasing the chance of spawning tinted rocks.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}}: Spawns 14 rock clusters.

