== Bugs ==
{{bug|dlc=r|Using {{p|XVI - The Tower?}} in a {{r|Boss Room}} may block all paths to the trap door, resulting in a softlock if no bombs or flight are available.}}
{{bug|dlc=r|Using {{p|XVI - The Tower?}} can also trap certain familiars over the rocks such as {{i|Lost Fly}} until Isaac leaves the room.}}

